configmap.yaml — stores normal app config as environment values
secret.yaml — stores sensitive values like passwords and keys
postgres-deployment.yaml — runs the Postgres database pod
postgres-service.yaml — lets other pods connect to Postgres
redis-deployment.yaml — runs the Redis pod
redis-service.yaml — lets other pods connect to Redis
web-deployment.yaml — runs your main web app pods
web-service.yaml — lets traffic reach the web app inside the cluster
worker-deployment.yaml — runs background job workers
postgres-pvc.yaml — keeps Postgres data from being lost when pods restart

